    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Search dated occurrence records for species with a substantial global absence followed by later occurrences, then audit taxonomy and dating. A validated reappearance of the identical biological species would refute the claim; no such cases supports it only within detection limits.";
